The bug lies in the getlin() routine in hack.tty.c.  This file includes
ctype.h, which defines isprint().  On some machines, isprint() answers
false to spaces, thus the error.  A fix is to change line 127 of
hack.tty.c from:

		} else if(isprint(c)) {
to:
		} else if(isprint(c) || c == ' ') {


